OL,3,GNEWSAGreen Party's Rachel Millward
OL,4,Afaces questions from BBC local radio
OL,5,Astations
OL,6,
OL,7,FRachel Millward, one of two Green Party
OL,8,Fdeputy leaders, is taking part in a
OL,9,Fseries of quick-fire interviews on BBC
OL,10,Flocal radio stations
OL,12,FHer party is preparing to host its
OL,13,Fautumn conference, which takes place in
OL,14,FBrighton from Friday
OL,16,FThe BBC local radio round has been a
OL,17,Fpre-conference tradition for many
OL,18,Fyears. The Conservatives, Greens,
OL,19,FLabour and Reform are all getting a
OL,20,Fsimilar opportunity before their
OL,21,Fconferences
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
